architecture-audit/baseline/risk-register.md:10:| 2 | God-modules block safe architectural change | Critical | High | `SvgCanvas.vue`, `ProjectionPlane.ts`, `World.ts`, `ThreeView.vue`, `App.vue` hotspots (`frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:181`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectionPlane.ts:176`, `frontend/src/domain/world/World.ts:113`) |
