architecture-audit/baseline/risk-register.md:38:**Evidence:** `SvgCanvas.vue` imports and coordinates model, rendering, tools, commands, stores, input, dialogs, and geometry (`frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:181`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:183`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:185`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:188`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:190`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:192`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:210`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:212`). `ProjectionPlane.ts` combines plane abstractions, element ownership, dependency side effects, construction helpers, and fixed/auxiliary implementations (`frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectionPlane.ts:176`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectionPlane.ts:248`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectionPlane.ts:333`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectionPlane.ts:399`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectionPlane.ts:1533`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectionPlane.ts:1635`). `World.ts`, `ThreeView.vue`, `App.vue`, `PaperService.ts`, and `ProjectService.ts` show similar concentration (`frontend/src/domain/world/World.ts:113`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:138`, `frontend/src/App.vue:273`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:108`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:98`).
architecture-audit/baseline/risk-register.md:52:**Consequence:** Tooling or rendering code may read stale store state while commands mutate `World`, making correctness dependent on implicit synchronization that is not visible in the central domain model.
architecture-audit/baseline/risk-register.md:110:**Evidence:** `PaperService` imports domain objects, world type, presentation primitives, style resolver, and low-level geometry helpers (`frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:33`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:34`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:35`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:36`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:43`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:54`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:71`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:72`). `ThreeView.vue` performs scene setup, projection-plane rendering, 2D element rendering, 3D element rendering, guide geometry rendering, and hinge-line rendering in one component (`frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:138`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:239`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:379`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:394`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:611`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:775`). `RenderService` contains test-only rendering paths while production uses `SVGRenderer` (`frontend/src/services/RenderService.ts:111`, `frontend/src/services/RenderService.ts:163`).
architecture-audit/baseline/risk-register.md:112:**Consequence:** 2D and 3D rendering rules may drift, and render-specific special cases may leak back into domain classes.
architecture-audit/baseline/risk-register.md:144:3. Only after central data boundaries are stable, split rendering/UI god-modules and introduce component-facing DTO/selectors (`frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:181`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:138`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:108`).
architecture-audit/baseline/architecture-map.md:7:The application is nominally layered as Vue entry/app shell → UI components/composables/stores/tools → command/operation sequences → domain world/process-tree/calculation model → rendering/persistence/integration services. In practice, several boundaries are porous: the domain root imports command and service layers, the canvas component directly constructs tools and operations, persistence reconstructs every operation class with a large switch, and multiple stores/components duplicate or bypass the canonical `World` ownership model. The largest god-modules are `SvgCanvas.vue`, `ProjectionPlane.ts`, `World.ts`, `ThreeView.vue`, `App.vue`, `PaperService.ts`, and `ProjectService.ts` by line count (`frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:181`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectionPlane.ts:176`, `frontend/src/domain/world/World.ts:113`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:64`, `frontend/src/App.vue:106`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:108`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:98`).
architecture-audit/baseline/architecture-map.md:13:`frontend/src/main.ts` is the frontend entry point: it imports global styles, registers descriptors, creates the Vue app and Pinia, installs Pinia, and mounts to `#app` (`frontend/src/main.ts:24`, `frontend/src/main.ts:27`, `frontend/src/main.ts:28`, `frontend/src/main.ts:30`, `frontend/src/main.ts:32`). `frontend/src/App.vue` is the application shell. It imports UI panels/dialogs, the command stack, deletion factory, stores, `World`, Drive service, and `ProjectService` (`frontend/src/App.vue:106`, `frontend/src/App.vue:115`, `frontend/src/App.vue:117`, `frontend/src/App.vue:118`, `frontend/src/App.vue:123`, `frontend/src/App.vue:124`, `frontend/src/App.vue:125`). It owns a mutable `world` instance and a singleton `CommandStack` (`frontend/src/App.vue:147`, `frontend/src/App.vue:151`), provides the command stack to descendants (`frontend/src/App.vue:152`), initializes Drive/local project state (`frontend/src/App.vue:273`), and handles save/open/autosave/keyboard/delete/select-all behavior (`frontend/src/App.vue:375`, `frontend/src/App.vue:416`, `frontend/src/App.vue:472`, `frontend/src/App.vue:801`, `frontend/src/App.vue:838`, `frontend/src/App.vue:905`).
architecture-audit/baseline/architecture-map.md:21:`App.vue` is both shell and application coordinator: it instantiates model/services, handles Google Drive flows, manages autosave timers, handles project lifecycle, drives command stack undo/redo, and performs selection/deletion orchestration (`frontend/src/App.vue:147`, `frontend/src/App.vue:160`, `frontend/src/App.vue:300`, `frontend/src/App.vue:323`, `frontend/src/App.vue:431`, `frontend/src/App.vue:472`, `frontend/src/App.vue:801`, `frontend/src/App.vue:1014`, `frontend/src/App.vue:1024`). `SvgCanvas.vue` is the main 2D workspace and imports model, presentation, rendering services, input service, command stack/operations, every concrete tool, stores, coordinate transforms, and dialogs in one component (`frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:181`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:183`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:184`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:185`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:186`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:187`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:188`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:190`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:192`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:210`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:212`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:218`).
architecture-audit/baseline/architecture-map.md:23:`ActionsPanel.vue` is not presentation-only: it imports process-tree and command types plus subprocess/process-tree operations, then builds commands from panel interactions (`frontend/src/components/panels/ActionsPanel.vue:52`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ActionsPanel.vue:54`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ActionsPanel.vue:55`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ActionsPanel.vue:56`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ActionsPanel.vue:57`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ActionsPanel.vue:58`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ActionsPanel.vue:59`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ActionsPanel.vue:60`). `ThreeView.vue` is also a large rendering/controller component; it imports Three.js, controls, domain world/projection-plane types, rendering service, stores, domain guide predicates, geometry utilities, and 3D rendering config (`frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:64`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:65`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:66`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:67`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:68`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:71`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:72`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:73`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:77`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:78`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:79`).
architecture-audit/baseline/architecture-map.md:68:6. **Rendering layers mix domain, service, and view concerns.** `ThreeView.vue` combines scene setup, geometry conversion, render loops, store access, and domain realization calls in one component (`frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:138`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:239`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:379`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:394`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:775`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:1040`). `PaperService` similarly performs primitive creation, visibility decisions, and special-case geometry handling (`frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:108`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:146`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:170`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:238`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:343`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:437`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:610`).
architecture-audit/baseline/architecture-map.md:72:- `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue` (1,867 lines) is a UI component, input controller, tool registry, rendering coordinator, drag/edit workflow, and command executor (`frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:181`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:262`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:314`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:1174`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:1272`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:1342`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:1440`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:1480`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:1688`).
architecture-audit/baseline/architecture-map.md:75:- `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue` (1,201 lines) is a 3D renderer, scene manager, world observer, helper geometry engine, and lifecycle manager (`frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:138`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:229`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:239`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:379`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:611`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:775`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:1040`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:1067`).
architecture-audit/baseline/architecture-map.md:76:- `frontend/src/App.vue` (1,172 lines) is shell plus project lifecycle, Drive auth, autosave, command stack, selection, keyboard shortcuts, and active-plane state (`frontend/src/App.vue:147`, `frontend/src/App.vue:160`, `frontend/src/App.vue:273`, `frontend/src/App.vue:375`, `frontend/src/App.vue:416`, `frontend/src/App.vue:472`, `frontend/src/App.vue:801`, `frontend/src/App.vue:881`, `frontend/src/App.vue:905`).
architecture-audit/baseline/architecture-map.md:92:Despite that type-only import, the active frontend persistence path is local/Drive-oriented: `App.vue` creates `ProjectService`/Drive flows, while `ProjectService` serializes command history and replays commands (`frontend/src/App.vue:160`, `frontend/src/App.vue:375`, `frontend/src/App.vue:416`, `frontend/src/App.vue:431`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:261`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:301`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:247`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:405`). The backend exposes Express project routes and a broad `ProjectDTO` (`backend/src/server.ts:14`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:4`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:11`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:6`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:13`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:50`), but the baseline found no normal frontend HTTP-client path using those project routes. The backend is therefore a parallel/disconnected persistence surface in the current architecture.
architecture-audit/baseline/architecture-map.md:96:`GeometryService`, `InputService`, and `ValidationService` form a tool-facing service layer around calculations and input conversion. `GeometryService` wraps calculations with `Result` return types (`frontend/src/services/GeometryService.ts:21`, `frontend/src/services/GeometryService.ts:30`, `frontend/src/services/GeometryService.ts:49`, `frontend/src/services/GeometryService.ts:64`); `InputService` owns viewport/screen transforms (`frontend/src/services/InputService.ts:17`, `frontend/src/services/InputService.ts:23`); `ValidationService` wraps domain geometry validation and infeasibility checks (`frontend/src/services/ValidationService.ts:9`, `frontend/src/services/ValidationService.ts:16`, `frontend/src/services/ValidationService.ts:33`, `frontend/src/services/ValidationService.ts:85`). This adds a tool→service→calculation path distinct from rendering/persistence services.
architecture-audit/baseline/quality-report.md:13:`SvgCanvas.vue` is 1,867 lines and imports domain model, presentation model, rendering services, input service, command stack, command operations, every concrete tool, stores, coordinate utilities, and dialogs (`frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:181`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:183`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:184`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:185`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:186`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:187`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:188`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:190`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:192`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:210`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:212`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:218`). It directly handles tool execution, command-stack injection, drag commits, clicks, wheel navigation, mouse handling, properties editing, and fit-to-view (`frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:314`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:430`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:1174`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:1298`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:1342`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:1440`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:1480`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:1688`). This makes the primary canvas difficult to test or refactor in isolation.
architecture-audit/baseline/quality-report.md:25:`App.vue` creates the world, command stack, and optional Drive service (`frontend/src/App.vue:147`, `frontend/src/App.vue:151`, `frontend/src/App.vue:160`), initializes Google/local project state (`frontend/src/App.vue:273`, `frontend/src/App.vue:300`, `frontend/src/App.vue:323`), creates/opens projects through `ProjectService` and Drive (`frontend/src/App.vue:375`, `frontend/src/App.vue:416`, `frontend/src/App.vue:431`), owns autosave interval state (`frontend/src/App.vue:472`, `frontend/src/App.vue:491`, `frontend/src/App.vue:515`), and implements delete/select-all/active-plane/keyboard behavior (`frontend/src/App.vue:801`, `frontend/src/App.vue:838`, `frontend/src/App.vue:881`, `frontend/src/App.vue:905`, `frontend/src/App.vue:1014`, `frontend/src/App.vue:1024`). This violates separation between UI composition and application use-cases.
architecture-audit/baseline/quality-report.md:27:### Q5. 3D rendering is concentrated in a large component
architecture-audit/baseline/quality-report.md:29:`ThreeView.vue` is 1,201 lines and combines Three.js setup, CSS2D labels, domain realization access, store access, projection-plane rendering, 2D-on-3D rendering, 3D-element rendering, guide perpendicular planes, guide intersections, hinge lines, reference axes, animation, resize, and cleanup (`frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:64`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:65`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:66`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:67`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:138`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:239`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:379`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:394`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:611`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:716`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:775`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:857`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:1040`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:1067`). A render adapter/service boundary is only partial (`frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:71`).
architecture-audit/baseline/quality-report.md:51:Autosave and 3D view handlers are stored on `window as any` (`frontend/src/App.vue:474`, `frontend/src/App.vue:491`, `frontend/src/App.vue:572`, `frontend/src/App.vue:1058`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:1143`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:1148`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ThreeView.vue:1151`). `GoogleDriveService` stores a token client as `any` and initializes Google Identity Services through `(window as any).google` (`frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:56`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:89`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:100`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:159`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:189`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:226`). This makes external integration behavior hard to type-check and mock.
architecture-audit/baseline/quality-report.md:65:`RenderService.ts` describes low-level rendering functions used by `PaperService`, but comments say line/plane rendering functions are only used in tests and production rendering uses `SVGRenderer` (`frontend/src/services/RenderService.ts:7`, `frontend/src/services/RenderService.ts:111`, `frontend/src/services/RenderService.ts:163`). Production canvas rendering flows through `SvgCanvas` → `PaperService` → `SVGRenderer` (`frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:167`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:185`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:186`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:578`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:108`, `frontend/src/services/SVGRenderer.ts:54`). This leaves test-only rendering code in the source service layer.
architecture-audit/baseline/quality-report.md:75:`App.vue` has unimplemented highlight/clear-highlight handlers and a TODO for error feedback (`frontend/src/App.vue:641`, `frontend/src/App.vue:650`, `frontend/src/App.vue:680`). `PaperService` has TODOs for visibility/infeasibility and missing element types (`frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:202`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:238`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:343`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:437`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:610`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:888`). `SVGRenderer` has a TODO around actual canvas dimensions (`frontend/src/services/SVGRenderer.ts:220`). These TODOs sit on rendering/feedback paths and should either become explicit wave scope or be deleted if obsolete.
architecture-audit/baseline/quality-report.md:83:`App.vue` logs credential state and autosave behavior (`frontend/src/App.vue:144`, `frontend/src/App.vue:522`), `ProjectService` logs migration/deserialization internals (`frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:235`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:317`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:321`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:326`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:353`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:366`), `PaperService` logs rendering internals (`frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:146`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:156`, `frontend/src/services/PaperService.ts:158`), and `GoogleDriveService` logs API/auth details and Drive file operations (`frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:82`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:108`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:475`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:527`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:556`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:631`). This adds noise and risks exposing integration metadata in normal browser consoles.
architecture-audit/baseline/quality-report.md:105:5. Extract application use-cases from `App.vue`, `SvgCanvas.vue`, `ActionsPanel.vue`, and `Toolbar.vue` so UI components stop constructing operations directly (`frontend/src/App.vue:375`, `frontend/src/components/workspace/SvgCanvas.vue:190`, `frontend/src/components/panels/ActionsPanel.vue:56`, `frontend/src/components/toolbars/Toolbar.vue:125`).
